Graded 5 docs in parallel: 1 relevant, 4 irrelevantDocuments: [Document(metadata={'char_count': 1019, 'pk': 462470511333799407, 'rerank_score': 0.16398024910404718}, page_content='说话人2: 00:59:07 - 00:59:15\n\nThe employee’s salary combined with our budget constitutes the total cost of the lighting project.\n\n说话人2: 00:59:15 - 00:59:29\n\nIt also takes into account the use of some other small materials, as well as items such as warranty costs. In fact, sometimes it includes other things as well.\n\n说话人2: 00:59:30 - 00:59:55\n\nProject management fees cover various types of expenses, which need to be accumulated one by one to arrive at the total amount. Here it can be seen that building permit application fees are also included, with a contingency reserve of 15% to 20% set aside for comprehensive budget composition assessment.\n\n说话人2: 00:59:55 - 00:59:58\n\nIn the ZIYUTEC team, how is the construction budget for electrical design training conducted?\n\n说话人2: 01:00:00 - 01:00:19\n\nThe content for today’s presentation has been finalized, and we still have 15 minutes left. Feel free to ask any questions. The questions are not limited to what was just discussed; we can address any topics covered today.'), Document(metadata={'char_count': 1004, 'pk': 462470511333799588, 'rerank_score': 7.254361823018916e-05}, page_content='You can report it to the engineering team again, then we can include this suggestion in the letter and submit it in the sbuild file. That’s fine, all of this is acceptable.\n\n说话人4: 01:08:15 - 01:08:16\n\nUh-huh,\n\n说话人1: 01:08:16 - 01:08:36\n\nThen this dimension will also be located within that building—meaning, where exactly it will be positioned. There’s another point—yes, one more thing—I’d like to ask the teacher: currently, how common are such EPC projects (engineering, procurement, and construction) domestically, especially compared to those in North America and other international markets? That is, projects combining construction and design.\n\n说话人2: 01:08:36 - 01:09:03\n\nEPC projects, which I will discuss later, are mostly large-scale industrial projects such as power plants, mines, and oil & gas projects. These projects operate under the EPC model. However, EPC practices vary across regions, such as Europe, Asia, and North America. I will provide a detailed explanation in the final lesson.'), Document(metadata={'char_count': 605, 'pk': 462470511333799145, 'rerank_score': 3.76364471809744e-05}, page_content='说话人1: 01:02:55 - 01:03:11\n\nSome drawings of vulnerabilities, or something like that. First, let me show you a school’s vulnerability system. It’s a college, a junior college, which was originally…\n\n说话人1: 01:03:12 - 01:03:34\n\nThe store specializing in this type of electronic equipment was called Bispa North America, a very large chain store. Later, this chain store relocated, and the school leased the space—it was a renovation project. Typically when we undertake such renovation projects, I might as well share some details with everyone. This particular renovation project…\n\n说话人1: 01:03:34 - 01:04:38'), Document(metadata={'char_count': 838, 'pk': 462470511333798972, 'rerank_score': 3.734356896287336e-05}, page_content='说话人10: 01:54:57 - 01:54:59\n\nTeacher Shen, I have a question.\n\n说话人1: 01:55:00 - 01:55:00\n\nYou said.\n\n说话人10: 01:55:01 - 01:55:12\n\nI believe you previously introduced our electrical design tools. May I ask which one is more mainstream between SKME-TOP and Easy Power that you mentioned?\n\n说话人3: 01:55:13 - 01:55:19\n\nCurrently, E-TOP is performing relatively well, with a higher market share in North America and better user experience.\n\n说话人10: 01:55:20 - 01:55:22\n\nDoes it have comprehensive features?\n\n说话人3: 01:55:22 - 01:55:23\n\nE-top is better.\n\n说话人10: 01:55:24 - 01:55:25\n\nOkay okay, thank you.\n\n说话人3: 01:55:27 - 01:55:32\n\nWe’ve covered two lessons so far. Does anyone have any questions?\n\n说话人4: 01:55:33 - 01:55:39\n\nHello, Teacher Fan, I have a question here, can you hear me? Yes, go ahead. Hello, Teacher Fan.\n\n说话人4: 01:55:40 - 01:56:03'), Document(metadata={'char_count': 479, 'pk': 462470511333799439, 'rerank_score': 3.400182010101328e-05}, page_content='说话人0: 00:15:37 - 00:19:19\n\nIn North America, as a colleague just asked about EPC, I can elaborate on this. EPC here is primarily used for certain civil, commercial, or municipal projects, similar to how it’s applied in China. These projects typically follow the Design-Build model, where the two phases are separate. The design is handled by consulting firms, and the client uses it for bidding. Construction is then carried out based on the contract—this is the standard format.')]
